{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Date With Yuika</strong> is visual novel about you, and a woman named Yuika. In a date, to talk about relationships and the future. Converse with Yuika and learn more about each other. Is this the time you have been waiting for to make your move?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will determine the ending of the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short branching narrative with player choices that affect the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One ending exclusive to the demo (the full version contains all 5 endings).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful date, with a beautiful woman named Yuika.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a romantic setting with relaxing background music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>DEMO version</strong> includes one ending, with a playtime around 25 minutes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139080?t=1762917989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4139080?t=1762917989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139080/4d6e39fb83b50be652fa1279cf73c49c742457ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762917989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139080/4d6e39fb83b50be652fa1279cf73c49c742457ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762917989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Date With Yuika</strong> is visual novel about you, and a woman named Yuika. In a date, to talk about relationships and the future. Converse with Yuika and learn more about each other. Is this the tim